探出，像浮在云上的冠冕。远景是云海、天光与更远处的宫阙剪影，画面顶部与两侧约四成是清晨明亮的天光负空间，几只仙鹤沿长阶向上飞。清晨低角度暖光从画面右前方照来，把长阶的白玉、宫灯与顶端仙宫的金顶勾成暖金，云海反射的浅青光补亮阶身暗侧，青绿、月白、鎏金构成壮阔而神圣的色调。云海、旗幡与朝圣者的衣摆朝同一方向被风扯动，云雾在长阶两侧翻涌。长阶的纵向中轴、宫灯的两条金线与顶端仙宫构成一条向上的纵深通道，把渺小的朝圣者置于通天长阶之下，让一条通往仙宫的路显得既辽远又壮阔。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 84, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [467.2631530761719, 350.646484375], "pos": [310, 0], "id": 67, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 98, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [977.7473754882812, 456.5628662109375], "pos": [1323.922607421875, 470.646484375], "id": 80, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 26}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 112, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535",